TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Aaa! Bu gerçekten istediğim{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} mı?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}
Bir tane bulduğuna İNANAMIYORUM,{{TAG:0005:0007:}}
!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}No way! Did you actually find {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} for me?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}It must have been so hard to
catch, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Yok artık! Benim için{{TAG:000E:0002:}} gerçekten{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
buldun{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}} mu? Yakalamak çok zor
olmuştur,{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Cidden mi? Benim için{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
yakaladığına{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} inanamıyorum!
Hayallerimin bile ötesinde,{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}GIBT'S JA GAR NICHT! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Du hast
mir {{TAG:000E:0008:00CD0A00650069006E0065006E000800650069006E0065000600650069006E00}} {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
gebracht?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Und das, obwohl die Tierchen so
superselten sind! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Wuhuuu!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Ich wusste, dass nur eine Person
so was Schwieriges schaffen kann!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:001F:}}Und das bist DU!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Oh! Guarda che bel pesce che
mi hai acchiappato!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
È {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¿De verdad que es {{TAG:000E:0001:}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} que pedí?
¿No me engañas?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}La verdad es que no tenía muchas
esperanzas, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡Pero lo has hecho, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Dur! Bu gerçekten istediğim{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} mı?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}
İstek fazla zor diye korkmuştum,{{TAG:0005:0008:}}
!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Ama BAŞARDIN,{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Haha!{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} ÇOK{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} mutluyum! Bana{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} buldun!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Çok meşgul olduğunu biliyorum;
yardımın benim için çok değerli,{{TAG:0005:0007:}}
.

{{TAG:0003:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Vay{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} vay VAY! Bana gerçekten{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
yakaladığına İNANAMIYORUM!
İnanılmazsın,{{TAG:0005:0008:}}; böyle nadir bir
balığı bulmak her babayiğidin
harcı değil,{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Non esiste! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Ma come hai fatto?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Vuoi dire che quest{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD02006F000200610002003000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} è per me?!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Cioè, è un pesce rarissimo! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Devo
fargli foto col cellulare così i miei
amici ci crederanno, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bana bir kelebek bulmanı{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}
umuyordum.{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} Türü{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} hiç fark etmez,{{TAG:0005:0007:}}
!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Mi porteresti uno {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}scarabeo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Uno qualsiasi, basta che abbia
un corno! {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}Grazie una cifra!

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Mi acchiapperesti un {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}coleottero{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Qualsiasi tipo va bene,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bana bir geyik böceği bulmanı{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}
umuyordum. Hangi{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} tür{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} olduğu hiç
fark etmez,{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hay que ver qué memoria tienes...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Atrápame una {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}libélula{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, por favor,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Unuttun mu? Güzel bir yusufçuk{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}
istiyorum.{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Türü hiç fark etmez,{{TAG:0005:0007:}}
!

FR:
Je vais quand même pas me mettre
à la pêche... {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Tu me ramènes {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, steuplaît ?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bana herhangi bir{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} nehir balığı{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
yakala, tamam mı? Türü hiç fark
etmez,{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ben senden deniz balığı
yakalamanı istemiştim.{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} Gerçekten{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
hangi{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} tür olduğu fark etmez,{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
